                  <run bold='true' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000a8' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Total Google search interest, i.e. the indexed number of search queries on Google Search (incl. Play Store). This is a proxy for how often users have searched for the respective brands. This data is based on &quot;exact match&quot; of users&apos; searches with a set of keywords provided by Delivery Hero.</run>
